{
  "info": {
    "name": "MotosHub API - Cuarto Avance (FastAPI)",
    "description": "Coleccion de pruebas de la API del cuarto avance (React + Vite + FastAPI + MySQL).\n\nOrden sugerido:\n1. Ejecutar 'Login administrador' (guarda el token automaticamente en la variable token_admin).\n2. Ejecutar 'Login empleado' y 'Login cliente' para probar el control de roles.\n3. Recorrer el resto de carpetas.\n\nFicha 3406211 - Instructor: Jhan Hader Munoz",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_admin", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_empleado", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_cliente", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "id_usuario", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "id_producto", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "id_servicio", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
